Packed int4 KV with per-token-head zero points, on Turing.

Extends the `int4_per_token_head` layout to SM75: asymmetric int4 with
per-(token, head) scales and zero points, dequantized inside the attention
kernels (fp16 dots, fp32 zero-point corrections) and materialized per step for
the prefill and verify paths. This is what lets 262,144 tokens of context live
in 5.5 GiB here; Turing has no int4 tensor cores, so every dot is fp16 or fp32.

